WEBVTT

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:06.230
Trevor, go! You shouldn't be here!

00:00:06.438 --> 00:00:11.902
Neither should you.
You're sneaking out again, aren't you?

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:16.073
- Neville, listen. We were...
- No, I won't let you!

00:00:16.323 --> 00:00:20.911
You'll get Gryffindor into trouble again.
Phfightyou.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:25.416
Neville, I'm really sorry about this.
Petrificus totalus.

00:00:33.382 --> 00:00:37.136
You're a little scary sometimes,
you know that?

00:00:37.428 --> 00:00:41.056
Brilliant, but scary.

00:00:41.724 --> 00:00:43.767
Let's go.

00:00:43.976 --> 00:00:48.230
Hermione: Sorry.
Ron: It's for your own good, you know.

00:00:53.652 --> 00:00:57.614
- You stood on my foot!
- Sorry.

00:01:01.493 --> 00:01:03.495
Hermione: Alohomora.

00:01:15.507 --> 00:01:18.135
Harry: Wait a minute. He's...

00:01:19.344 --> 00:01:21.513
."Snonng.

00:01:24.016 --> 00:01:29.521
Harry: Snape's already been here.
He's put a spell on the harp.

00:01:31.148 --> 00:01:34.151
Ron: It's got horrible breath.

00:01:36.695 --> 00:01:38.822
- Harry: We have to move its paw.
- What?

00:01:39.031 --> 00:01:40.449
Come on!

00:01:44.495 --> 00:01:46.538
Okay. Push.

00:02:09.728 --> 00:02:13.357
I'll go first. Don't follow
until I give you a sign.

00:02:13.565 --> 00:02:18.570
If something bad happens,
get yourselves out.

00:02:19.363 --> 00:02:22.825
Does it seem a bit quiet to you?

00:02:23.534 --> 00:02:25.369
The harp.

00:02:26.036 --> 00:02:28.747
It's stopped playing.

00:02:30.165 --> 00:02:34.545
Ugh. Yuck!

00:02:38.757 --> 00:02:39.925
Harry: Jump!

00:02:54.106 --> 00:02:57.734
Lucky this plant thing's here, really.

00:03:12.124 --> 00:03:15.252
Hermione: Stop moving, both of you.
This is devil's snare.

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:19.131
You have to relax. If you don't,
it will only kill you faster.

00:03:19.381 --> 00:03:24.386
Kill us faster?
Oh, now I can relax!

00:03:26.638 --> 00:03:27.973
Hermione!

00:03:28.557 --> 00:03:32.311
- Now what are we gonna do?
- Hermione: Just relax!

00:03:32.561 --> 00:03:37.065
- Hermione, where are you?
- Do what I say! Trust me.

00:03:40.944 --> 00:03:43.071
Harry!

00:03:44.156 --> 00:03:47.492
- Are you okay?
- Yeah, I'm fine.

00:03:47.659 --> 00:03:50.746
- He's not relaxing, is he?
- Apparently not.

00:03:50.954 --> 00:03:53.498
- We've gotta do something.
- What?

00:03:53.665 --> 00:03:56.627
I remember reading something
in herbology.

00:03:57.502 --> 00:04:01.340
Devil's snare, devil's snare.
It's deadly fun...

00:04:01.548 --> 00:04:05.928
But will sulk in the sun!
That's it! It hates sunlight.

00:04:06.178 --> 00:04:08.180
Lumus solem.

00:04:16.313 --> 00:04:18.857
- Ron, you okay?
- Yeah.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:24.071
Lucky we didn't panic.

